# Runtime vars/secrets for `wrangler dev`, mirroring what you'd set with
# `wrangler secret put <NAME>` or in the dashboard under
# Workers & Pages > hm-realty-crm-frontend > Settings > Variables and Secrets.
#
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill in for local testing.
# These are read in worker/index.ts via `env.NAME` — NOT the VITE_* vars in .env,
# which are build-time only and baked into the static bundle.
